        "type": "paragraph",
        "html": "<em>I think I am bleeding. The left side of my face is warm and sticky and I think I am bleeding. I can’t see much (<strong>and oh God my ears are ringing what is this damned ringing</strong>?) but I lift a hand to my face and it comes away wet. I try to look at it (<strong>ring ring ring time for Prayers</strong>) and I can see again, the flashing stars are disappearing and I see my hand is wet and red. I moan.</em>"
