        "html": "<em>I’m on the ground, back against a hard surface. Wood, maybe. My head rings but the noise is gradually fading. Best thing to do would be to get up. Get up and see what’s happening but then I can’t, I can’t move, and now my steadying vision blurs because I’m puking. The acid in my throat leaves me gasping and drives out all thought for a full minute. And now the ringing is gone and I can hear clearly and what I hear is horrible.</em>"
