        "html": "I hope these little snapshots give you a good idea of the <strong>Fear </strong>lurking behind every second of this game. The constant resource management is a powerful if subtle terror, eating away at you all the time. The more extreme fear of being killed by something bigger and nastier than you is rare and temporary, but when it comes it strikes you right at your core. It won’t matter how many cans of dog food you have, a predator may stalk you until one of you is dead."
